<title>UK: LVMH sets $200 mln three-year bond.</title>
<headline>LVMH sets $200 mln three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers BNP Capital Markets and Credit Suisse Frist Boston.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LVMH MOET HENNESSY LOUIS VUITTON</p>
<p> AMT	  $200 MLN  COUPON     6.75	MATURITY    02.MAY.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.055   PAY DATE    02.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.88     SPREAD	+12 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/GB/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    FRENCH    HOME CTRY  FRANCE    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.20	SELL CONC  1.175     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 5.875 PCT U.S. T-NOTE DUE FEB.2000</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
